    { "raw_text": "CONTENT WARNINGS", "seed_translations": { "zh": "内容警告" } },
    { "raw_text": "<b>Randomised names & Faces</b> \n<size=20>(Characters in-game use random combinations of common names, faces, and facial features. Resemblance to anyone real or otherwise is merely coincidence.)</size>\n\n<b>Flashing lights</b>\n<size=20>(The world and interfaces contain flashing colors which may be dangerous to those with photosensitive epilepsy.)</size>\n\n<b>Mature Topics</b>\n<size=20>(The game contains references to topics such as death, blood, injury, violence, drugs & alcohol, occult, coercion, corruption, and imprisonment.)</size>\n\n<b>Survival Gameplay</b>\n<size=20>(Staying alive is part of the challenge of Ostranauts. You will almost certainly die often at first. Careful preparation and clever problem-solving required ahead.)</size>\n\n<b>Early Access Game</b>\n<size=20>(Ostranauts is still under active development, and subject to change and the occasional bug.)</size>", "seed_translations": { "zh": "<b>随机姓名与面孔</b> \n<size=20>(游戏中的角色使用随机组合的常见姓名、面孔和面部特征。与任何真实或虚构人物的相似纯属巧合。)</size>\n\n<b>闪烁光线</b>\n<size=20>(世界和界面包含闪烁色彩，可能对光敏性癫痫患者造成危险。)</size>\n\n<b>成人话题</b>\n<size=20>(游戏涉及死亡、流血、受伤、暴力、毒品与酒精、神秘学、胁迫、腐败和监禁等话题。)</size>\n\n<b>生存玩法</b>\n<size=20>(生存是《星际拾荒者》挑战的一部分。初期你几乎肯定会频繁死亡。需要提前做好周密准备并巧妙解决问题。)</size>\n\n<b>抢先体验游戏</b>\n<size=20>(《星际拾荒者》仍在积极开发中，内容可能发生变化，偶尔会有漏洞。)</size>" } },
    { "raw_text": "• Ship-to-ship Combat\n• Fire & Smoke\n• Asteroid Mining\n• New Region: Ceres\n• Steam Deck™ & Gamepad Support\n• Performance Improvements & more...", "seed_translations": { "zh": "• 舰对舰战斗\n• 火灾与烟雾\n• 小行星采矿\n• 新区域：谷神星\n• Steam Deck™ 与手柄支持\n• 性能改进及更多内容……" } },
    { "raw_text": "We're active on Discord and other communities,\nwhere players help us shape the game experience.", "seed_translations": { "zh": "我们活跃于 Discord 及其他社区，\n玩家会在那里帮助我们塑造游戏体验。" } },
    { "raw_text": "You can find links to these resources on the main\nmenu, and in-game through the Options menu.", "seed_translations": { "zh": "你可以在主菜单中找到这些资源的链接，\n也可以在游戏内通过选项菜单访问。" } },
